1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,928
One weapon. A whole new way to play.
一把武器，带来全新的打法。

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:10,181
Build a twenty-card deck in a single-player RPG where gear changes the rules.
构筑二十张牌的牌组，进入装备能改变打法的单人 RPG。

3
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,336
Choose your contract.
选择契约，

4
00:00:12,336 --> 00:00:15,786
Start with a weapon and a deck ready for battle.
带着起始武器与完整牌组出战。

5
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:20,844
Every slot shapes your build: weapon, armor, trinket, and seal.
每个槽位都能塑造打法：武器、护具、饰物与刻印。

6
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:26,716
Spread fire across their ranks. Turn armor into a finishing blow.
让火焰波及敌阵，把护甲化作致命一击。

7
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:31,031
Cast a spell. Play its Echo. Keep the combo going.
施放法术，再打出回声，让连奏继续。

8
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:36,844
Hold your best cards. Read the enemy's plan. Make every trade count.
留住关键手牌，看清敌方计划，让每次交换都有价值。

9
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:43,227
Cross three chapters. Break their defenses. Bring down the commander.
穿越三个章节，拆解敌方防线，击败指挥官。

10
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:48,159
Clear a chapter, earn gold, and choose from three rewards.
通关章节，赚取金币，再从三项奖励中选择一项。

11
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:53,093
Pursue exclusive gear on higher difficulties.
挑战更高难度，追逐专属装备。

12
00:00:53,093 --> 00:00:54,798
Keep the equipment you earn.
获得的装备永久保留。

13
00:00:55,080 --> 00:01:00,355
Spend earned gold on packs. Break the seal. Reveal five cards.
用赚到的金币购买卡包，破开封印，逐张揭晓五张牌。

14
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,728
Mix schools. Discover legendary cards.
混搭学派，发现传奇卡牌，

15
00:01:03,728 --> 00:01:05,670
Save a build that plays your way.
保存属于你的打法。

16
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,832
Your collection stays with you.
收藏始终保留。

17
00:01:08,832 --> 00:01:12,575
Return to camp, change your loadout, and go again.
回到营地，调整配装，再次出发。

18
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:17,648
Conquer the story. Take your build into the Endless Corridor.
通关故事章节，带着构筑踏入无尽回廊。

19
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:23,311
Push your build further. Beat your personal best.
让构筑走得更远，突破自己的最佳纪录。

20
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:27,710
Unlock animated card backs with your points.
用积分解锁动态卡背，

21
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:29,798
Give your deck a signature look.
让牌组拥有自己的标志性风格。

22
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:33,512
From the battlefield to every pack you open,
从战场牌堆到每次开包，

23
00:01:33,512 --> 00:01:35,206
carry your signature style.
让你的风格始终相伴。

24
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:38,162
Build your next advantage.
构筑你的下一次优势。
